            "content": "<h3><strong>Is it more durable than standard cables?</strong></h3><p><br/>Yes. Most cables fail after 10,000 bends. Titan Cable Pro is tested to survive over 300,000 thanks to reinforced military-grade fibers and a 90° anti-break Stress-Defender™ head.</p><p></p><p></p><h3></h3><h3><strong>Does it work with all my devices?</strong></h3><p><br/>Yes. It’s universally compatible with USB-C, Lightning, and Micro USB — covering iPhone, Android, laptops, tablets, Switch, GoPro, and more.</p><p></p><h3></h3><h3><strong>Will it work with my case?</strong></h3><p><br/>Yes. The low-profile 90° connector is designed to fit through most protective phone cases — even thick ones.</p><p></p><p></p><h3></h3><h3><strong>How fast does it charge?</strong></h3><p><br/>Up to 100W with a USB-C PD charger — enough to charge most phones in under 30 minutes or power a laptop at full speed. <em>To unlock max speed, pair it with the Titan PD Plug above.</em></p><p></p><p></p><h3></h3><h3><strong>Is it safe for battery health?</strong></h3><p><br/>Yes. The built-in SmartChip regulates current to prevent overheating and battery degradation — protecting battery health long term.</p><p></p><p></p><h3></h3><h3><strong>Can I use it for data transfer?</strong></h3><p><br/>Yes. It supports USB 3.1 Gen 2 transfer — ideal for fast syncing of files, photos, music, and 4K video.</p><p></p><p></p><h3></h3><h3><strong>Is it car compatible?</strong></h3><p><br/>Yes. It works with all USB car chargers and supports both Apple CarPlay and Android Auto without interruption.</p><p></p><p></p><h3></h3><h3></h3><h3><strong>Are the magnets safe?</strong></h3><p><br/>Yes. AutoMag™ Wind-Up uses low-strength surface magnets that don’t interfere with your phone, battery, or payment cards.</p><p></p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_WkxVG7": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Tech Specs",
            "content": "<h3><strong>Materials</strong></h3><ul><li>Titan-reinforced core - same material used in body armor</li><li>Military-grade braided nylon - resists fraying and tearing</li><li>90° aluminum alloy connectors - engineered to prevent breakage</li><li>Magnetic self-coiling design - stays tidy in your bag, pocket, or desk</li></ul><h3><strong><br/>Performance</strong></h3><ul><li>Supports up to 100W fast charging - charge your phone to 50% in under 20 minutes</li><li>SmartChip tech - protects from overheating, power surges, and battery damage</li><li>USB 2.0 data transfer - up to 480 Mbps for reliable syncing</li><li>Tested to withstand 50,000+ bends - 10x stronger than standard cables</li></ul><h3><strong><br/>Compatibility</strong></h3><ul><li>USB-C to USB-C & Lightning and USB-A to USB-C & Lightning setups supported</li><li>Works with phones, tablets, laptops, power banks, and more</li></ul><h3><strong><br/>Warranty</strong></h3><ul><li>2 Year Warranty - Rest asured, your product is backed by our 2-year warranty.</li></ul>"
          }
        }
